the sims allows you to simulate  life and customize my new details of  your characters and their homes but you  may not know about the stranger weirder  lore that lies beneath the surface of  the long beloved series  the biggest mystery involves one of the  most well-known sims  ever bella goth  [Music]  i know i'm not the only one with  nostalgic memories of making bizarre  families and create a sim as a kid  but many of the pre-made sims have  detailed personalities  interests relationships and mysteries  long time players might recognize some  of these characters and family names  like land grab  newbie and bachelor but i guarantee the  conspiracies and connections between  them run deeper than you know  bella goth has appeared in her iconic  red dress in just about every sims game  in the sims 1 the elegant and athletic  bella lives with her husband mortimer  and her daughter cassandra at five sim  lane  she enjoys reading chess golf and  mourning over tombstones  but in the summer of 2004 shortly before  the sims 2  bella goes missing the in-game story  never  explicitly states what happened to her  but fragments of evidence might just  allow us to piece the mystery  together if your sim uses a fingerprint  scanner on the furniture in the goth  family's house  you'll find that most of the furniture  was recently touched by bella meaning  she hasn't been gone for too long  the weirdest part is bella does  technically exist  in the game but she's hidden within the  game code and can only be found using  cheats or third-party programs  this version of her has no personality  points career  memories or aspirations on the goth  family tree panel bella's portrait is in  color not in black and white which  implies that the game doesn't consider  her to be deceased  while the goth family in pleasant view  mourns bella's disappearance  drinking milk from cartons that bear her  missing person notice  she inexplicably appears by herself in  the mysterious desert community of  strange town  except things aren't quite right with  her she has no memories of her family or  her past  a different voice and a slightly  different appearance and personality  than the bella hidden within pleasant  view  she can also be befriended and married  poor mortimer thinks his wife is missing  when she's really just out in the desert  partying to katy perry  but it's a proven nope it turns out that  bella was last seen denying advances  from  don lothario her daughter's promiscuous  fiance on his patio  the last thing she did before vanishing  to strange town was look into dawn's  telescope  if you've played the sims you may  already know that telescopes are the  most sure-fire way to be abducted by  aliens  aliens and alien abductions are  long-established aspects of the sims  series  in different games you can visit other  planets make an alien a part of your  family  and even have alien children  extraterrestrials have attempted to  overthrow simnation multiple times and  are able to completely disguise their  appearance and voices to perfectly blend  in with humans  so you can never truly know who's real  and who might just be an  alien in disguise in fact strange town  is home to many anomalies and peculiar  citizens including quite a few aliens  strange town is an odd place littered  with secret labs a nuclear power plant  and a cult that worships a cow demon  named beelzebeef  but the most notable landmark in the  town is a ufo sitting broken down  in a crater where it crashed the ufo  could belong to one of the town's alien  residents  like pollination tech number nine smith  an alien man who quote  really thinks his human disguise is  working hmm  it's said in game that the crashed ufo  came to deliver  a personal item to pt9 smith who knows  what that could imply  but if that was the ufo that abducted  bella goth  then maybe she was the delivery although  mortimer and cassandra have memories of  seeing bella be abducted by aliens it's  unexplained what exactly happened to her  up there  her lost memories are usually chalked up  to alien experiments wiping her mind but  due to the inexplicable differences  between her pleasant view and strange  town selves  some suspect strange town bella is  actually a clone or an alien  impersonating her but developer maxis  insists that the two distinct bellas are  the same person  in terms of the game's storyline they  even published a written interview with  bella on the sims 2 website that  explains her disappearance  denies the existence of a clone and  mentions faint memories of  green men with black eyes maybe she does  just have amnesia but  then again if she was a clone that's  probably just what the aliens would want  us to think  in the online interview with bella she  says that she's tried to go home to  mortimer cassie and alex but  she says there's something strange about  this town every time i try to leave  i end up back here in the sims 3 which  takes place earliest  in the series timeline bella is a child  growing up in sunset valley just down  the road from her childhood friend and  future husband mortimer  however it's assumed the sims 3 follows  multiple alternate timelines because  while bella is still a kid  her gravestone exists at the same time  on a neighboring  planet producer sarah holding confirmed  bella goth's headstone in the lunar  lakes graveyard belongs to the same  bella from the sims 2.  but lunar lakes bella has a completely  different appearance with yellow hair  greenish skin  and a grim face apparently she simply  died of old age  meaning we know that she didn't die from  drowning in a pool without a ladder or  from being stuck behind an  impassable obstacle like poorly placed  furniture  it's unknown how or when bella got to  lunar lakes or if she ever even reunited  with her family after her abduction  but it seems possible that she may have  been abducted again or that she set out  for the stars in search of her abductors  maybe by using strange town's ufo sims 4  sadly abandons many of these previous  story lines while still including  alternate universe versions of many  characters including bella goth as a  young adult as well as the very first  pre-made sims  bob and betty newby who appear as bob  and eliza pancakes  however an expansion pack for the sims 4  features the desert town strangerville  which clearly references strange town  and its alien residence  featuring conspiracy theorists a  mysterious crater  in the roswell family which references  the 1947  roswell new mexico ufo incident even if  the lore behind bella goth runs thin  in the newer games fun references and  supernatural easter eggs are  ever present as you might expect there  are countless fan theories speculating  further what happened to bella goth  since the details don't quite add up  one theory involves the caliente sisters  who were both romantically involved with  don lothario and who moved into  pleasantview the night before bella  disappeared  just after bella was abducted by aliens  her wealthy husband mortimer began  dating dina caliente this might sound  like a reality show love triangle so far  but might i add that the caliente  sisters are part  alien some think that because of this it  could be possible that after bella  rejected don lothario he was worried  she'd rat him out to her daughter and  his fiance cassandra  so he called up the caliente sisters to  use their alien family connections to  wipe bella's memory  and while dina was there she used the  opportunity to take bella out of the  picture and move in on mortimer and his  money  but of course that's all just  speculation and forum theories  whether you play the sims to make your  own characters decorate eclectic  mansions or achieve your sims career  aspirations  even if that aspiration is eating  grilled cheese every day  it's undeniable that the sims lore has  some strange stories  and a colorful cast of characters we  might never know what exactly bella saw  when she looked through that telescope  but with countless easter eggs hidden  imagery and  iterations of bella throughout dozens of  games she is  undoubtedly one of the most recognizable  enigmatic sims in the series  hopefully her story continues going  forward the truth has to be out there  [Music]  you

